 Without limiting the generality of the provisions of the last paragraph of Section 14.5 , for purposes of determining compliance with the conditions specified in this Section 7.1 , each Lender that has signed this Agreement shall be deemed to have consented to, approved or accepted, or been satisfied with each document or other matter required thereunder to be consented to or approved by or acceptable 
