 (d) commercial paper and similar obligations rated “P-1” by Moody’s or “A-1” by S&P; 
 (e) readily marketable Tax-free municipal bonds of a domestic issuer rated “A-2” or better by Moody’s or “A” or better by S&P, and maturing within one year from the date of issuance; 
 (f) mutual funds or money market accounts investing primarily in items described in clauses (b) through (e) above; 
 (g) demand deposit accounts maintained in the ordinary course of business; 
 (h) current trade and customer accounts receivable that are for goods furnished or services rendered in the ordinary course of business and that are payable in accordance with customary trade terms; 
